            <h1>About Leago Academy</h1>

            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>Leago Academy is an AI‑powered education platform built for African learners. Our mission is to make quality, personalised learning accessible to every student, regardless of their location or background.</p>

            <h2>What We Do</h2>
            <p>We provide an AI Tutor that guides students through their curriculum subjects step‑by‑step. Whether you are in Grade 10 struggling with Algebra or in Grade 12 preparing for exams, our AI adapts to your level and explains concepts clearly.</p>

            <h2>Why African Learners?</h2>
            <p>We understand the unique challenges facing African education – large class sizes, limited resources, and diverse curricula. Leago Academy is designed to supplement classroom learning with personalised, on‑demand tutoring that is always available.</p>

            <h2>Our Approach</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Personalised:</strong> The AI adapts to your grade, curriculum, and learning pace.</li>
                <li><strong>Curriculum‑aligned:</strong> We support CAPS, IEB, CBC, WAEC, and ZIMSEC.</li>
                <li><strong>Interactive:</strong> We use Socratic questioning to guide you to answers, not just give them.</li>
                <li><strong>Affordable:</strong> We offer a free trial and a low‑cost Premium plan so every learner can benefit.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Our Technology</h2>
            <p>Leago Academy is built on modern AI (DeepSeek), secure cloud infrastructure, and a focus on data privacy. We are continuously improving to serve our learners better.</p>

